stands in the way of every single proposal

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:25.990
to try to stop future foreign election interference
including and primarily from Russia.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.880
People have been showing up at his public
events and just chanting Moscow Mitch Louder

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.289
than his microphone will go.

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:32.340
